---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Treasure Valley Website Design & Digital Presence | Brighter Sites"
  description="Custom website design, technical SEO, Google Business Profile, Search Console, analytics, domains, and ongoing digital presence support for small businesses across Meridian, Boise, Eagle, Nampa, Kuna, Star, and the Treasure Valley."
>
  <section class="page-intro local-intro">
    <div class="container local-hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Treasure Valley website design</p>
        <h1>Website design and digital presence support for Treasure Valley small businesses.</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="local-lead">
        <p>
          Brighter Sites helps small businesses across Meridian, Boise, Eagle,
          Nampa, Kuna, Star, and the surrounding Treasure Valley build a stronger
          online presence through custom websites, search-ready structure,
          local search setup, analytics, and ongoing website support.
        </p>
        <p>
          We work with small businesses broadly and have specialized experience
          with therapists, counselors, coaches, wellness professionals, and other
          service businesses where trust and a clear path to contact matter.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section tint">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading local-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Local website & digital presence services</p>
        <h2>More than a website that simply looks local.</h2>
        <p>
          Local visibility is built from several parts working together: a clear
          website, accurate business information, useful service pages, technical
          SEO, local search signals, and measurement after launch.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="local-service-grid">
        <article>
          <h3>Small business website design</h3>
          <p>
            Custom website structure and design built around your business,
            services, customers, and the action you want visitors to take.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Technical SEO & search visibility</h3>
          <p>
            Search-ready titles, headings, internal links, crawlability,
            metadata, sitemap support, canonical signals, mobile usability, and
            other technical foundations that help search engines understand the site.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Google Business Profile support</h3>
          <p>
            Setup or optimization of the business profile so core information,
            services, website links, and local business details stay consistent
            with the website.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Google Search Console & analytics</h3>
          <p>
            Connect and review the tools that reveal search impressions, clicks,
            indexed pages, traffic sources, and website activity so decisions can
            be based on real information.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Domain, DNS & Cloudflare</h3>
          <p>
            Help with the technical infrastructure behind the public site,
            including domain connection, DNS records, Cloudflare, HTTPS, and
            launch configuration.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Website maintenance & Managed Growth</h3>
          <p>
            Optional monitoring, routine updates, search review, analytics review,
            and prioritized improvements after launch.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container local-split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Service area</p>
        <h2>Serving businesses across the Treasure Valley.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="local-copy">
        <p>
          Brighter Sites serves small businesses throughout the Treasure Valley,
          including Meridian, Boise, Eagle, Nampa, Kuna, and Star. Projects can
          be handled online, so businesses outside the area are welcome too.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not create a different thin page for every nearby city just to
          repeat the same keywords. This page represents the real local market we
          serve while the rest of the site explains the actual services and
          specialties available.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section local-why-section">
    <div class="container local-split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Why local businesses care</p>
        <h2>Your website and your local Google presence should reinforce each other.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="local-copy">
        <p>
          A potential customer may first encounter your business through a Google
          search result, a Business Profile, Maps, a referral, or a direct link.
          When they reach the website, the business name, services, location or
          service area, contact information, and overall presentation should make
          sense together.
        </p>
        <p>
          Brighter Sites focuses on that connected digital presence rather than
          treating the website, local search, analytics, and domain setup as
          unrelated tasks.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section tint">
    <div class="container local-split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Digital marketing support</p>
        <h2>A focused alternative to a full-service marketing agency.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="local-copy">
        <p>
          Some businesses searching for “digital marketing” are really looking
          for help with the foundation: a better website, stronger local search
          information, technical SEO, Search Console, analytics, domains, and a
          plan for keeping the site current.
        </p>
        <p>
          That is where Brighter Sites fits. We do not currently position the
          business as a full-service paid advertising, social media management,
          or email marketing agency. We focus on the website and organic digital
          presence those channels depend on.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container local-split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Specialized experience</p>
        <h2>All small businesses are welcome. Trust-based practices are a specialty.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="local-copy">
        <p>
          Brighter Sites started by solving website and launch problems for a
          counseling practice. That created deeper experience with businesses
          where customers need to understand the person, service, process, and
          next step before they feel comfortable reaching out.
        </p>
        <div class="local-specialty-links">
          <a class="text-link" href="/therapist-websites/">Therapist & counselor website design →</a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/coaching-websites/">Coach website design →</a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/wellness-practitioner-websites/">Wellness professional website design →</a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/small-business-websites/">All small-business website services →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">Free 15-minute consultation</p>
        <h2>Talk through your Treasure Valley business website.</h2>
        <p>
          Tell me what you have now, what you want to improve, and what parts of
          your online presence you would rather have handled for you.
        </p>
        <a class="button" href="/contact/#consultation">Request a free consultation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .local-hero-grid,
  .local-split {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .local-intro h1 {
    max-width: 14ch;
  }

  .local-lead,
  .local-copy {
    max-width: 48rem;
  }

  .local-lead p + p,
  .local-copy p + p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .local-heading {
    max-width: 54rem;
  }

  .local-service-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .local-service-grid article {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: white;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  }

  .local-service-grid h3 {
    margin-bottom: .55rem;
  }

  .local-why-section {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #d6e4e1;
  }

  .local-why-section h2 {
    color: white;
  }

  .local-why-section .eyebrow {
    color: #9fd1c8;
  }

  .local-specialty-links {
    display: grid;
    gap: .65rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .local-hero-grid,
    .local-split {
      grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .local-service-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 70rem) {
    .local-service-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
</style>
